# Template for the deployed-state hub and its cluster-status round-trip.
# @W@/@H@/@NAME@ are substituted by scripts/screenshot/run.sh.
Output out/@NAME@-hub-dashboard.txt
Set Shell zsh
Set FontSize 14
Set Padding 0
Set LineHeight 1.0
Set LetterSpacing 1.0
Set Width @W@
Set Height @H@

Hide
Type `export PATH="$(dirname "$OKDCTL_DEMO_BIN"):$PATH" HOME="$OKDCTL_DEMO_HOME" OKDCTL_WIZARD_DEMO=1; cd "$OKDCTL_DEMO_CWD"; clear`
Enter
Show

Type "okdctl deploy"
Sleep 450ms
Enter
Wait+Screen@10s /cluster status/
Sleep 500ms
Screenshot out/@NAME@-hub-dashboard.png
Sleep 300ms
Type "s"
Wait+Screen@10s /CLUSTER STATUS · Running/
Wait+Screen@2s /NODES · 6/
Screenshot out/@NAME@-cluster-status.png
Sleep 300ms
Enter
Wait+Screen@2s /Selected node/
Screenshot out/@NAME@-cluster-status-details.png
Sleep 300ms
Escape
Wait+Screen@10s /\[d\] deploy/
Type "n"
Wait+Screen@10s /choose an operation/
Screenshot out/@NAME@-hub-manage.png
Sleep 300ms
Escape
Wait+Screen@10s /\[d\] deploy/
Ctrl+C
Sleep 500ms
